version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-09
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.21281648
repository-code: https://github.com/benjiesotelo-sudo/Telos
url: https://telos-stats.pages.dev
license: AGPL-3.0
abstract: >-
  Browser-based statistical analysis for thesis students. All computation runs
  client-side in WebR (R compiled to WebAssembly), so data never leaves the
  browser. 48 statistical tests with APA tables, figures, plain-language
  guidance, method citations, and reproducible R script exports, each verified
  against native R.
keywords:
  - statistics
  - webr
  - webassembly
  - r
  - apa
  - thesis
  - structural-equation-modeling
